ks everyone in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity flips, physics break, ragdolls happen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and a lot more that you'll find out the hard way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/extras/455361ab5d4ca547a1d9e2feed92b05c.poster.avif?t=1788292500\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/extras/455361ab5d4ca547a1d9e2feed92b05c.webm?t=1788292500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/extras/455361ab5d4ca547a1d9e2feed92b05c.mp4?t=1788292500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHY PEOPLE KEEP PLAYING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No round is the same. The event combinations are unpredictable enough that after ten sessions you're still hitting new situations. Rounds are short. Setups take thirty seconds. Nobody needs to read a tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also extremely easy to clip. The moments are fast, visual, and loud. Streamers who've played it haven't needed to explain why it's funny, it's obvious from the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/extras/58107bd75689047da29df2b20a84547f.poster.avif?t=1788292500\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/extras/58107bd75689047da29df2b20a84547f.webm?t=1788292500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/extras/58107bd75689047da29df2b20a84547f.mp4?t=1788292500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Press the button. Something horrible happens. Last player standing wins. 2–8 players. Zero rules. Pure chaos.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian, Japanese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/edf86e288fb0c9a6ae1e3c378ac1c01d70f688a8/header.jpg?t=1788292500", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/7a7ef1d61551ae3d12a356e23ead1724defd41fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788292500", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597390/7a7ef1d61551ae3d12a356e23ead1724defd41fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788292500", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-12600KF / AMD Ryzen 5 7600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 Super / RTX 3060 / RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Saint Mazzed"], "publishers": ["Saint Mazzed"], "demos": [{"appid": 4841720, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "